    <item>
      <title>King Aldric</title>
      <link>https://northwaldia.com/characters/king-aldric/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://northwaldia.com/characters/king-aldric/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;biography&#34;&gt;Biography&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Aldric is the 42nd monarch of &lt;a href=&#34;https://northwaldia.com/countries/northwaldia-country/&#34;&gt;Northwaldia&lt;/a&gt;. Known&#xA;as the &amp;ldquo;Sage of the Terminal,&amp;rdquo; he is famous for his unconventional&#xA;method of ruling his domain entirely via plain-text files and shell&#xA;scripts.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;He shares his throne with &lt;a href=&#34;https://northwaldia.com/characters/queen-elysia/&#34;&gt;Queen Elysia&lt;/a&gt;, who oversees the&#xA;kingdom&amp;rsquo;s cryptographic defenses. Unlike her husband, Elysia prefers a&#xA;more &amp;ldquo;Debian-stable&amp;rdquo; approach to governance, leading to lively&#xA;midnight debates in the royal court.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;early-life&#34;&gt;Early Life&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Aldric&amp;rsquo;s birth in &lt;a href=&#34;https://northwaldia.com/events/king-aldric-birth/&#34;&gt;the royal house of Northstar&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;is often treated as the beginning of the modern Northwald succession.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>King Belson</title>
      <link>https://northwaldia.com/characters/king-belson/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://northwaldia.com/characters/king-belson/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;biography&#34;&gt;Biography&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Aldric is the 42nd monarch of &lt;a href=&#34;https://northwaldia.com/countries/northwaldia-country/&#34;&gt;Northwaldia&lt;/a&gt;. Known as the &amp;ldquo;Sage of the Terminal,&amp;rdquo; he is famous for his unconventional method of ruling his domain entirely via plain-text files and shell scripts.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;He shares his throne with &lt;a href=&#34;https://northwaldia.com/characters/queen-elysia/&#34;&gt;Queen Elysia&lt;/a&gt;, who oversees the kingdom&amp;rsquo;s cryptographic defenses. Unlike her husband, Elysia prefers a more &amp;ldquo;Debian-stable&amp;rdquo; approach to governance, leading to lively midnight debates in the royal court.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;conflict-with-the-south&#34;&gt;Conflict with the South&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Currently, Aldric&amp;rsquo;s forces are engaged in a long-standing border dispute with &lt;a href=&#34;https://northwaldia.com/countries/south-isles/&#34;&gt;South Isles&lt;/a&gt;. This war began not over land or gold, but over a disagreement regarding the default init system for the regional network.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
